<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_465a6df4-d1a6-43a0-b33d-75d8de2b9129"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Survival of causes of action after death</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_db038c42-cb5a-41c6-b348-8a1aa7c7819a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_e22e04e9-5763-4b3c-a1f6-9e7e162f50aa"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Effect of death on certain causes of
action</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9d44dd70-b747-4a1b-b058-3de158942b2e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to the provisions of this section, on the
death of any person after the commencement of this Act all causes of action
subsisting against or vested in the person shall survive against, or, as the
case may be, for the benefit of, the person&#8217;s estate: Provided that this
subsection shall not apply to causes of action for defamation or seduction or
for inducing one spouse to leave or remain apart from the other or to claims
under Division 2 of Part 3 of the <legref refid="act-1984-147" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Property (Relationships)
Act 1984</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f8633672-3a15-4355-9fc0-bda374a41e3a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where a cause of action survives as aforesaid for
the benefit of the estate of a deceased person, the damages recoverable for
the benefit of the estate of that person:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_212985cc-9dc2-412a-bd75-72c32707e86d" id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">shall not include:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6ad2ead8-f271-4c12-9ad9-d1c715d156d1"
id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.a-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any exemplary damages, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b568eb4c-9133-4d8b-bd95-2573386065b6"
id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.a-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any damages for the loss of the capacity of the
person to earn, or for the loss of future probable earnings of the person,
during such time after the person&#8217;s death as the person would have
survived but for the act or omission which gives rise to the cause of
action,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_72bff275-d93d-4603-a812-f2e6143b4fc7" id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a breach of promise to marry shall
be limited to such damage, if any, to the estate of that person as flows from
the breach of promise to marry,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7ba85b4f-9542-4cc6-b0be-b1f67a725f81" id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">where the death of that person has been caused by
the act or omission which gives rise to the cause of action, shall be
calculated without reference to any loss or gain to the person&#8217;s estate
consequent on the person&#8217;s death, except that a sum in respect of
funeral expenses may be included,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1de23ce7-a791-4313-b6c7-f544eb4c5a1b" id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">where the death of that person has been caused by
the act or omission which gives rise to the cause of action, shall not include
any damages for the pain or suffering of that person or for any bodily or
mental harm suffered by the person or for the curtailment of the
person&#8217;s expectation of life.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.3" status="repealed">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fc993477-a48f-4ec8-964e-b37d6a8d0d25"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="status" value="repealed"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b9589adf-da31-49ac-89ea-7e5167115b40"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where damage has been suffered by reason of any
act or omission in respect of which a cause of action would have subsisted
against any person if that person had not died before or at the same time as
the damage was suffered, there shall be deemed, for the purposes of this Part,
to have been subsisting against the person before the person&#8217;s death
such cause of action in respect of that act or omission as would have
subsisted if the person had died after the damage was
suffered.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0f6067d3-acd7-4bbe-8a65-700d5f74ae93"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The rights conferred by this Part for the benefit
of the estates of deceased persons shall be in addition to and not in
derogation of any rights conferred on the dependants of deceased persons by
the <legref refid="act-1897-031" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Compensation to Relatives Act 1897</i></name></legref>, as
amended by subsequent Acts, and so much of this Part as relates to causes of
action against the estates of deceased persons shall apply in relation to
causes of action under the said Act as so amended as it applies in relation to
other causes of action not expressly excepted from the operation of subsection
(1).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_792cbd4e-0e5b-4bf0-b923-2423eb8d3e5d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The rights conferred by this Part for the benefit
of the estates of deceased persons and the obligations continued or created by
this Part against the estates of deceased persons shall be in addition to and
not in derogation of any rights conferred or obligations created by or under
the <legref refid="act-1942-015" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Motor Vehicles (Third Party Insurance) Act
1942</i></name></legref> or the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Transport Accidents Compensation Act
1987</i></name></legref> or the <legref refid="act-1988-102" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Motor Accidents Act
1988</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8aa8ea73-c088-4de6-aff7-d9cc0500421a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(7)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section has effect subject to section 12B of
the <legref refid="act-1989-063" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Dust Diseases Tribunal Act
1989</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


